  "reasoning_content": "Let me analyze this chapter carefully to extract facts.\n\nThe chapter is about:\n1. A cold storage facility's temperature controller tripped before noon\n2. A whole box of lychees started seeping water\n3. Warehouse keeper 裴小棠 changed the goods status from \"待发\" (pending shipment) to \"报损\" (reported damage)\n4. She notified the driver to cancel the afternoon trip to 港东批发市场\n5. The driver replied \"知道了\" (understood) and turned off the already-started truck\n6. The seepage water flowed along the pallet to the ground\n7. 裴小棠 went to get a mop\n\nLet me extract facts:\n\n1. 冷库温控器在午前跳闸 - 设备状态\n2. 整箱荔枝开始渗水 - 状态\n3. 裴小棠把货从\"待发\"改成\"报损\" - 行动\n4. 裴小棠通知司机取消下午去港东批发市场的车 - 行动/言语事件\n5. 司机回\"知道了\" - 言语事件\n6. 司机把已发动的货车熄了火 - 行动\n7. 渗出水顺着托盘流到地面 - 状态\n8. 裴小棠去拿拖把 - 行动\n\nLet me think about what status each should be:\n\n1. 冷库温控器在午前跳闸 - 已发生 (温控器跳闸已经发生)\n2. 整箱荔枝很快开始渗水 - 已发生 (已经渗水)\n3. 仓管裴小棠把这批货从\"待发\"改成\"报损\" - 已发生\n4. 裴小棠通知司机取消下午那趟去港东批发市场的车 - 已发生 (言语事件/交办)\n5. 司机回了一句\"知道了\" - 已发生 (言语事件)\n6. 司机把已经发动的货车熄了火 - 已发生\n7. 渗出水顺着托盘流到地面 - 正在发生 (顺着托盘流到地面是现在进行的状态)\n8. 裴小棠又去拿拖把 - 已发生 (她去拿了)\n\nNow let me think about whether I need speaker fields. These are mostly narrative facts, not speech acts, so speaker can be omitted for most. For the speech events (通知, 回了一句), these are described by the narrator, not direct quotes from a person. So they don't need speaker field - they're described actions.\n\nLet me draft the evidence strings carefully:\n\n1. \"冷库的温控器在午前跳闸\" - this is the fact\n2. \"整箱荔枝很快开始渗水\" \n3. \"仓管裴小棠把这批货从\"待发\"改成\"报损\"\" - the fact mentions 仓管, I should preserve that\n4. \"通知司机取消下午那趟去港东批发市场的车\"\n5. \"司机回了一句\"知道了\"\"\n6. \"便把已经发动的货车熄了火\"\n7. \"渗出水顺着托盘流到地面\"\n8. \"裴小棠又去拿拖把\"\n\nLet me write the facts:\n\n1. fact: \"冷库温控器在午前跳闸\", status: \"已发生\", evidence: \"冷库的温控器在午前跳闸\"\n\n2. fact: \"整箱荔枝因温控器跳闸开始渗水\", status: \"已发生\", evidence: \"整箱荔枝很快开始渗水\" - Actually, let me keep facts more neutral. The fact about cause is implied (\"很快\" suggests because of the temperature controller). But strictly, the text says the temperature controller tripped and then the lychees started seeping - the causal link is clear from the sequence. Let me be careful - \"很快\" indicates temporal immediacy, suggesting cause. But to be safe, I can just say \"整箱荔枝开始渗水\" as a fact.\n\nActually, re-reading: \"冷库的温控器在午前跳闸，整箱荔枝很快开始渗水\" - this is clearly causal. The \"很快\" implies right after the trip. I think it's reasonable to note the causal connection, but to be safe, let me keep it as two separate facts or combine the cause-effect.\n\nLet me separate:\n- 冷库温控器在午前跳闸\n- 整箱荔枝开始渗水 (with implicit causation from context)\n\nActually, the facts are clearly connected. Let me write:\n- \"冷库的温控器在午前跳闸\" - status: 已发生\n- \"整箱荔枝开始渗水\" - status: 已发生\n\n3. fact: \"仓管裴小棠将这批荔枝从'待发'改成'报损'\", status: \"已发生\", evidence: \"仓管裴小棠把这批货从\"待发\"改成\"报损\"\"\n\n4. fact: \"裴小棠通知司机取消下午去港东批发市场的车\", status: \"已发生\", evidence: \"并通知司机取消下午那趟去港东批发市场的车\"\n\n5. fact: \"司机回应裴小棠'知道了'\", status: \"已发生\", evidence: \"司机回了一句\"知道了\"\"\n\n6. fact: \"司机将已经发动的货车熄了火\", status: \"已发生\", evidence: \"便把已经发动的货车熄了火\"\n\n7. fact: \"渗出水顺着托盘流到地面\", status: \"正在发生\", evidence: \"渗出水顺着托盘流到地面\"\n\n8. fact: \"裴小棠去拿拖把\", status: \"已发生\", evidence: \"裴小棠又去拿拖把\"\n\nWait, regarding #4 - \"通知司机取消下午那趟去港东批发市场的车\" - this is the 交办, which is a 已发生 speech event. The driver then replied \"知道了\" which could be interpreted as acknowledgment, but is it a 承诺? The text says the driver just said \"知道了\" and then turned off the truck. Saying \"知道了\" is just acknowledging hearing, not necessarily a promise. But the act of turning off the truck is the action that follows, which is the actual compliance.\n\nI should keep #4 as the 交办 (已发生) and the driver's response as 已发生的言语事件. The action of turning off the truck is already executed (已发生), so I don't need a separate 承诺.\n\nLet me also consider - the goods were destined for 港东批发市场 in the afternoon - this is implicit information from \"下午那趟去港东批发市场的车\". This is a fact about the planned trip.\n\nActually, do I need a fact about the afternoon trip plan? The text implies there was a planned trip to 港东批发市场 in the afternoon, but the focus is on the cancellation. Let me not add this unless it's significant. The core fact is that the trip is being cancelled.\n\nLet me also think about whether the \"取消\" is a plan or already executed. The text says 裴小棠 \"通知司机取消\" - this is the act of instructing. The driver said \"知道了\" and then turned off the truck. So the cancellation has been communicated and acted upon. The fact of the trip being cancelled can be stated as \"下午去港东批发市场的车次被取消\" or I can keep it as the notification event.\n\nI think the cleanest approach is:\n- 裴小棠通知司机取消下午去港东批发市场的车 (已发生的交办)\n- 司机回应\"知道了\" (已发生的言语事件)\n- 司机将已发动的货车熄了火 (已发生的行动)\n\nThese three together show the cancellation in progress.\n\nOne more thing - \"仓管裴小棠\" - this identifies 裴小棠's role as 仓管 (warehouse keeper). I should record this as a fact too, but since it's mentioned in passing, I'll fold it into the action fact.\n\nActually, the role \"仓管\" is mentioned as a description. This is a fact about her identity. Let me record it as a separate fact or keep it in the action.\n\nLooking again: \"仓管裴小棠把这批货从\"待发\"改成\"报损\"\" - the \"仓管\" here is a noun describing her role. It's a fact that her role is 仓管. But for the action fact, I can include it.\n\nLet me finalize:\n\n1. fact: \"冷库温控器在午前跳闸\", status: \"已发生\", evidence: \"冷库的温控器在午前跳闸\"\n2. fact: \"整箱荔枝开始渗水\", status: \"已发生\", evidence: \"整箱荔枝很快开始渗水\"\n3. fact: \"仓管裴小棠将一箱荔枝从'待发'状态改为'报损'\", status: \"已发生\", evidence: \"仓管裴小棠把这批货从\"待发\"改成\"报损\"\"\n4. fact: \"裴小棠通知司机取消下午去港东批发市场的车次\", status: \"已发生\", evidence: \"并通知司机取消下午那趟去港东批发市场的车\"\n5. fact: \"司机回应裴小棠'知道了'\", status: \"已发生\", evidence: \"司机回了一句\"知道了\"\"\n6. fact: \"司机将已经发动的货车熄了火\", status: \"已发生\", evidence: \"便把已经发动的货车熄了火\"\n7. fact: \"渗出水顺着托盘流到地面\", status: \"正在发生\", evidence: \"渗出水顺着托盘流到地面\"\n8. fact: \"裴小棠去拿拖把\", status: \"已发生\", evidence: \"裴小棠又去拿拖把\"\n\nWait, for #3, I should be careful. \"这批货\" could be multiple boxes, not just the one mentioned. But the text says \"整箱荔枝\" and then \"仓管裴小棠把这批货\". \"这批货\" refers to the lychees. Let me write \"裴小棠将这批渗水荔枝从'待发'状态改为'报损'\" or just \"裴小棠将这批货从'待发'状态改为'报损'\".\n\nLet me also reconsider - the \"仓管\" prefix is descriptive. Should I keep it in the fact? It's an identity fact. I think including it in the fact about her action is fine, or I can separate it. Let me keep it for completeness.\n\nActually, since the role \"仓管\" is stated explicitly, I should probably record it as a fact about 裴小棠's identity. But it's mentioned as a descriptive term, not as a standalone fact. Looking at the rules, I should record \"身份\" facts. Let me add it.\n\n9. fact: \"裴小棠的身份是仓管\", status: \"已发生\", evidence: \"仓管裴小棠把这批货从\"待发\"改成\"报损\"\"\n\nHmm, but this is just an attributive. Let me not over-extract. I'll keep \"仓管裴小棠\" as part of the action fact, and not extract a separate identity fact because it's not the main purpose of the sentence. The rules say to record identities - let me add it briefly.\n\nActually, let me re-read the rules: \"抽取范围包括人物的行动、状态、身份、关系、所在地、持有物、认知和目标\"\n\nSo 身份 is explicitly in scope. Let me add a separate fact for 裴小棠's role.\n\nLet me also think about location - they are in a 冷库 (cold storage). The fact that the setting is 冷库 is established. This could be a location fact.\n\n10. fact: \"事件发生地点为冷库\", status: \"已发生\", evidence: \"冷库的温控器在午前跳闸\" - Hmm, this is implied context. The temperature controller belongs to the cold storage. I'll add it.\n\nLet me also think - the text says \"冷库的温控器\" - this tells us the location is the cold storage. \n\nOK let me consolidate and finalize. I'll include:\n1. 冷库温控器在午前跳闸\n2. 整箱荔枝开始渗水\n3. 仓管裴小棠将渗水荔枝从\"待发\"改为\"报损\" (combining role and action)\n4. 裴小棠通知司机取消下午去港东批发市场的车次\n5. 司机回应\"知道了\"\n6. 司机将已发动的货车熄了火\n7. 渗出水顺着托盘流到地面\n8. 裴小棠去拿拖把\n\nI think these cover everything important. The role of 裴小棠 as 仓管 is included in fact #3. I don't need to extract every descriptive word as a separate f